(3012907, 423582, 65886, '<td valign="top">wonderful lines!</td>', 'wonderful lines!', '2006-11-08 04:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012909, 423208, 65886, '<td valign="top">very impressive!</td>', 'very impressive!', '2006-11-08 04:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012910, 424343, 5354, '<td valign="top">Hold back on the saturation slider just a little</td>', 'Hold back on the saturation slider just a little', '2006-11-08 04:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012911, 423562, 65886, '<td valign="top">excellent reflection!</td>', 'excellent reflection!', '2006-11-08 04:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012934, 424336, 65886, '<td valign="top">I totally agree! the only thing that matters is not to forget to look at my reflection when I go out:) just kidding. beautiful poetic photo!</td>', 'I totally agree! the only thing that matters is not to forget to look at my reflection when I go out:) just kidding. beautiful poetic photo!', '2006-11-08 05:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012939, 424493, 5354, '<td valign="top">Ooooh hold back that saturation slider a little</td>', 'Ooooh hold back that saturation slider a little', '2006-11-08 05:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012976, 424330, 5354, '<td valign="top">The contrast in this image is way too low. It feels like we are looking through frosted glass. It also needs something inthe foreground as nothing really happens in the image until halfway up. The bottom third could be cropped as it doesn''t contribute anything to the image</td>', 'The contrast in this image is way too low. It feels like we are looking through frosted glass. It also needs something inthe foreground as nothing really happens in the image until halfway up. The bottom third could be cropped as it doesn''t contribute anything to the image', '2006-11-08 05:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012977, 422089, 5354, '<td valign="top">OMG a headless duck!!!<br/>The reflection is not strong enough to carry this composition. The reflected duck is too dark because you exposed for the real duck, but then you cropped it out. If you are intending the reflection to be the major element then expose for that and lose the original totally.</td>', 'OMG a headless duck!!!The reflection is not strong enough to carry this composition. The reflected duck is too dark because you exposed for the real duck, but then you cropped it out. If you are intending the reflection to be the major element then expose for that and lose the original totally.', '2006-11-08 05:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012980, 424088, 5354, '<td valign="top">The simple literal reflection, but presented updide down, doesn''t really work.<br/>Its competent enough, but has no inspiration.</td>', 'The simple literal reflection, but presented updide down, doesn''t really work.Its competent enough, but has no inspiration.', '2006-11-08 05:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012981, 424196, 5354, '<td valign="top">So whats the main element? - ithe baby''s ear?<br/>The reflection is just an incidental or secondary element and for a ''reflections'' challenge that is not enough.<br/> <br/>As a prtrait it also struggles becasue the viewer can''t connect with the subject, the eyes are hidden. Just imaging if the baby had just glanced up and caught you taking the pic. Now that would have had some impact.<br/> <br/>For a reflections challenge - I can only ive it a 4 - sorry</td>', 'So whats the main element? - ithe baby''s ear?The reflection is just an incidental or secondary element and for a ''reflections'' challenge that is not enough. As a prtrait it also struggles becasue the viewer can''t connect with the subject, the eyes are hidden. Just imaging if the baby had just glanced up and caught you taking the pic. Now that would have had some impact. For a reflections challenge - I can only ive it a 4 - sorry', '2006-11-08 05:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012982, 422339, 41337, '<td valign="top">Splendid image. It definitely meets the challenge but for me this doesn''t separate itself from the countless images just like this one. If there were any technical mistakes I''d be giving this a 6 but since there are none it gets a 7. Good luck.</td>', 'Splendid image. It definitely meets the challenge but for me this doesn''t separate itself from the countless images just like this one. If there were any technical mistakes I''d be giving this a 6 but since there are none it gets a 7. Good luck.', '2006-11-08 05:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012984, 423897, 5354, '<td valign="top">The candle cannot be distinguished, it might have well been a fluorescent light.<br/>The greatest problem though is the composition - you have cropped off the right hand side of the eye, leaving a huge expanse of out of focus nose on the left hand side. Why? I guess you were thinking of the rule of thirds, well in this case you could have broken that rule.</td>', 'The candle cannot be distinguished, it might have well been a fluorescent light.The greatest problem though is the composition - you have cropped off the right hand side of the eye, leaving a huge expanse of out of focus nose on the left hand side. Why? I guess you were thinking of the rule of thirds, well in this case you could have broken that rule.', '2006-11-08 05:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012988, 423069, 41337, '<td valign="top">Good reflections and symmetry. While the centered horizon works well here and is a welcome departure from the typical rule of thirds approach overall it still lacks originality. Would have loved to see you try this as a diagonal composition.</td>', 'Good reflections and symmetry. While the centered horizon works well here and is a welcome departure from the typical rule of thirds approach overall it still lacks originality. Would have loved to see you try this as a diagonal composition.', '2006-11-08 05:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3012989, 423794, 5354, '<td valign="top">Compositionally this is a real tough call. You wanted the lights and the reflections obviously, but you have no real foreground except that tiny triangle in the right corner. Foregrounds need to be stronger and more prominent. There is a huge expanse of black in the bottom left which contributes nothing, and the sky is taking up half the image without contributing too much either.<br/> <br/>My recomendation would be to have concentrated on a smaller section of the town lights and make a stronger feature of the narrow stripe which actually cotains the reflection. Get in closer next time</td>', 'Compositionally this is a real tough call. You wanted the lights and the reflections obviously, but you have no real foreground except that tiny triangle in the right corner. Foregrounds need to be stronger and more prominent. There is a huge expanse of black in the bottom left which contributes nothing, and the sky is taking up half the image without contributing too much either. My recomendation would be to have concentrated on a smaller section of the town lights and make a stronger feature of the narrow stripe which actually cotains the reflection. Get in closer next time', '2006-11-08 05:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013003, 423209, 5354, '<td valign="top">Macros of coins and other table top stuff rarely do well in DPC. We have all seen them over and over again. They are a favourite of the newcomers to DPC because they are a nice easy set up, something you can do in the kitchen or spare room.<br/> <br/>They are really something to practice with, not something which is a competition image as such.<br/> <br/>This example has blown highlights and hasn''t really any great detail, the junction between the table top and the background also needs to be disguised somehow.</td>', 'Macros of coins and other table top stuff rarely do well in DPC. We have all seen them over and over again. They are a favourite of the newcomers to DPC because they are a nice easy set up, something you can do in the kitchen or spare room. They are really something to practice with, not something which is a competition image as such. This example has blown highlights and hasn''t really any great detail, the junction between the table top and the background also needs to be disguised somehow.', '2006-11-08 05:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013006, 424323, 5354, '<td valign="top">As you will no doubt see when you are voting, glasses and reflections in glasses very rarely do well. The exceptions are technically perfect and artistic. By pointing that out I guess what I''m getting to is that this example doesn''t really exhibit any of those qualities</td>', 'As you will no doubt see when you are voting, glasses and reflections in glasses very rarely do well. The exceptions are technically perfect and artistic. By pointing that out I guess what I''m getting to is that this example doesn''t really exhibit any of those qualities', '2006-11-08 05:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013050, 423162, 1908, '<td valign="top">excellent shoot awsome. would love to see this at sunset</td>', 'excellent shoot awsome. would love to see this at sunset', '2006-11-08 06:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013063, 423720, 40797, '<td valign="top">This Rocks! Your composition is excellent and the reflection that you captured is simply amazing, it''s crystal clear!!</td>', 'This Rocks! Your composition is excellent and the reflection that you captured is simply amazing, it''s crystal clear!!', '2006-11-08 06:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3013065, 424490, 1908, '<td valign="top">nice shoot the reflection would have tried to get it sharper k</td>', 'nice shoot the reflection would have tried to get it sharper k', '2006-11-08 06:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
