(3013582, 423188, 64175, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors chosen.  The infrared shots are always neat.  In regards the challenge itself, I don''t get a feeling of "reflection" from this. The shadows overwhelm the top of the lake so I feel it is those shadows that are to be my focus.  There is a hint of blue on the lake from the reflection but there are no definitions (outlines) within the blue to show me a reflection.  5.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors chosen.  The infrared shots are always neat.  In regards the challenge itself, I don''t get a feeling of "reflection" from this. The shadows overwhelm the top of the lake so I feel it is those shadows that are to be my focus.  There is a hint of blue on the lake from the reflection but there are no definitions (outlines) within the blue to show me a reflection.  5.', '2006-11-08 09:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
