(3014337, 424454, 52130, '<td valign="top">wow! very colorful. I didn''t know there were tide pools around there, but I guess that''s due to the recent rain. Very awesome pic, the only thing that bothers me is the lower right corner b/c it''s a little to high key and pulls the eye away from the bridge(s). I think you could''ve gotten away with cropping out the lower part of the tide pool and balancing that by cropping out just a tad of the left vertical side. Still, it''s one of the better ones here and I''m sure it will do well.<br/> <br/>Oh and one last thing, next time make it BIGGER...just a suggestion :)</td>', 'wow! very colorful. I didn''t know there were tide pools around there, but I guess that''s due to the recent rain. Very awesome pic, the only thing that bothers me is the lower right corner b/c it''s a little to high key and pulls the eye away from the bridge(s). I think you could''ve gotten away with cropping out the lower part of the tide pool and balancing that by cropping out just a tad of the left vertical side. Still, it''s one of the better ones here and I''m sure it will do well. Oh and one last thing, next time make it BIGGER...just a suggestion :)', '2006-11-08 12:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
