(3014649, 424358, 66201, '<td valign="top">I think if the "real" branches and foliage had been focused, I would have given this a higher score. As it is however, it''s a welcome relief from the reflected grand scale landscapes in lakes.</td>', 'I think if the "real" branches and foliage had been focused, I would have given this a higher score. As it is however, it''s a welcome relief from the reflected grand scale landscapes in lakes.', '2006-11-08 13:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
