(3015188, 424454, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how, no matter how many times I''ve seen a shot of the same subject, there''s always a new perspective somewhere.  This is just awesome!  Congrats on a really nice shot with a vantage point I don''t recall seeing before.</td>', 'It''s amazing how, no matter how many times I''ve seen a shot of the same subject, there''s always a new perspective somewhere.  This is just awesome!  Congrats on a really nice shot with a vantage point I don''t recall seeing before.', '2006-11-08 15:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
