(3015360, 424343, 63495, '<td valign="top">great reflection. I am new to photography so take take my comment with a grain of salt. i like the shot but it seem to me the colors are over saturated and it bothers me that the background sky is blown out</td>', 'great reflection. I am new to photography so take take my comment with a grain of salt. i like the shot but it seem to me the colors are over saturated and it bothers me that the background sky is blown out', '2006-11-08 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
