(3015614, 422184, 48339, '<td valign="top">very cool. the wires suck. also i think a tighter shot with more of the bridges reflections and less of the buildings back there would be even better. maybe you could have got those wires out of the frame by trying this. i really like the brickwork on what appears to be an old bridge. nice colors.</td>', 'very cool. the wires suck. also i think a tighter shot with more of the bridges reflections and less of the buildings back there would be even better. maybe you could have got those wires out of the frame by trying this. i really like the brickwork on what appears to be an old bridge. nice colors.', '2006-11-08 18:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
