(3017199, 423993, 60223, '<td valign="top">Clean, crisp and an interesting reflection and subject, especially the spilled liquid.  Minor issues for me are the tilted horizon, the seam in the surface on the top left edge, the dust spot on the sensor and those white squiggly lines in the standing glass kind of detracts from the perfect gradient.  What are those squiggly lines anyway, something in the liquid or a reflection?</td>', 'Clean, crisp and an interesting reflection and subject, especially the spilled liquid.  Minor issues for me are the tilted horizon, the seam in the surface on the top left edge, the dust spot on the sensor and those white squiggly lines in the standing glass kind of detracts from the perfect gradient.  What are those squiggly lines anyway, something in the liquid or a reflection?', '2006-11-09 09:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017207, 421401, 60223, '<td valign="top">Picture needs more contrast and perhaps exposing one stop lower to allow for a deeper blue in the sky.</td>', 'Picture needs more contrast and perhaps exposing one stop lower to allow for a deeper blue in the sky.', '2006-11-09 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017213, 424146, 67258, '<td valign="top">I am going to have to take it on trust that a part of this image is a reflection as it isn''t readily apparant to me.  Nevertheless, I like it very much, and I look forward to reading your description.</td>', 'I am going to have to take it on trust that a part of this image is a reflection as it isn''t readily apparant to me.  Nevertheless, I like it very much, and I look forward to reading your description.', '2006-11-09 09:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017215, 423251, 67006, '<td valign="top">I think this''d make a cool pic if it was cropped vertically, through the trees on either side of the house--tall and thin.  Love the atmosphere, the house makes me want to investigate further!  Nice!</td>', 'I think this''d make a cool pic if it was cropped vertically, through the trees on either side of the house--tall and thin.  Love the atmosphere, the house makes me want to investigate further!  Nice!', '2006-11-09 09:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017226, 424323, 67258, '<td valign="top">This confuses me, as the writing is the right way round - more like a projection!  I am not keen on the partial desaturation, but the photo is effective.</td>', 'This confuses me, as the writing is the right way round - more like a projection!  I am not keen on the partial desaturation, but the photo is effective.', '2006-11-09 09:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017234, 423196, 60223, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if the orange in the bottom left was put in  to add some color, tension or to fill in an empty area in the photo or because you couldn''t get the reflection without having it sticking into the picture.  I would prefer that it wasn''t there as it distracts greatly from what should be the main subject of the photo, the lighthouse and then the beautiful trees.</td>', 'I''m not sure if the orange in the bottom left was put in  to add some color, tension or to fill in an empty area in the photo or because you couldn''t get the reflection without having it sticking into the picture.  I would prefer that it wasn''t there as it distracts greatly from what should be the main subject of the photo, the lighthouse and then the beautiful trees.', '2006-11-09 09:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3017238, 424184, 60223, '<td valign="top">Although you''ve captured an excellent reflection it is such a small part of this photo that it hardly stands out and is easily overpowered by the dimly lit building that doesn''t do much for the eye.</td>', 'Although you''ve captured an excellent reflection it is such a small part of this photo that it hardly stands out and is easily overpowered by the dimly lit building that doesn''t do much for the eye.', '2006-11-09 09:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
