(3017905, 421978, 60223, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, normally the chess figures on the board pictures are boring but this one works well for this challenge and I like the strong contrast between the brights of the pieces and the darkness of the board.  I would prefer a tighter crop at the top cutting off up to the edge of the corner of the board.</td>', 'Very nice picture, normally the chess figures on the board pictures are boring but this one works well for this challenge and I like the strong contrast between the brights of the pieces and the darkness of the board.  I would prefer a tighter crop at the top cutting off up to the edge of the corner of the board.', '2006-11-09 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
