(3020891, 423906, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love this composition and the reflection is wonderful. Somehow the vivid blue of the sky (and its reflection) detract from the subdued colors of the rest of the scene, making it look a little drab. I think I''d try toning down the sky or cropping it out. The rest of colors are lovely.</td>', 'I love this composition and the reflection is wonderful. Somehow the vivid blue of the sky (and its reflection) detract from the subdued colors of the rest of the scene, making it look a little drab. I think I''d try toning down the sky or cropping it out. The rest of colors are lovely.', '2006-11-10 19:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3020894, 424467, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the multilayer reflection and the patterns created by the petals.</td>', 'I like the multilayer reflection and the patterns created by the petals.', '2006-11-10 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
