(3021380, 421401, 739, '<td valign="top">This could have used some Photoshop work to give the color in the photo a bit more punch.  It''s too flat for my taste.</td>', 'This could have used some Photoshop work to give the color in the photo a bit more punch.  It''s too flat for my taste.', '2006-11-11 01:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021382, 424196, 739, '<td valign="top">hahaha.  I love the baby!</td>', 'hahaha.  I love the baby!', '2006-11-11 01:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021383, 421978, 739, '<td valign="top">Interesting that you chose the King''s reflection as the point of focus.  I didn''t think it was appropriate until I realize it was the King.  I found my eyes drifting around looking for something sharp.  Started in the middle of the frame, but wonder all around before I found it.  You might have exchanged the position of the Queen with the King.</td>', 'Interesting that you chose the King''s reflection as the point of focus.  I didn''t think it was appropriate until I realize it was the King.  I found my eyes drifting around looking for something sharp.  Started in the middle of the frame, but wonder all around before I found it.  You might have exchanged the position of the Queen with the King.', '2006-11-11 01:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021385, 421847, 739, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t you use the same knife to kill 3 times instead of using 3 separate knifes? Just kidding.  This is the most creative shot of all the ones I''ve seen so far.  You got a reflection off the "bottom" of the water instead of the "top".  Great thinking.</td>', 'Couldn''t you use the same knife to kill 3 times instead of using 3 separate knifes? Just kidding.  This is the most creative shot of all the ones I''ve seen so far.  You got a reflection off the "bottom" of the water instead of the "top".  Great thinking.', '2006-11-11 01:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021387, 424274, 739, '<td valign="top">Too much boring sky.  Would have cropped it tighter.</td>', 'Too much boring sky.  Would have cropped it tighter.', '2006-11-11 01:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021390, 424296, 739, '<td valign="top">Too busy.  Think you should have focused on just one boat or a row of boats.</td>', 'Too busy.  Think you should have focused on just one boat or a row of boats.', '2006-11-11 01:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021391, 424384, 739, '<td valign="top">That''s creepy.  Where''s the bird?</td>', 'That''s creepy.  Where''s the bird?', '2006-11-11 01:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
