(3021398, 424360, 739, '<td valign="top">Very interesting that you exposed for the reflection.  Great choice! Wait! Ah, almost got tricked.  Did you rotate the image 180 degrees? The floating leaves gave it away.</td>', 'Very interesting that you exposed for the reflection.  Great choice! Wait! Ah, almost got tricked.  Did you rotate the image 180 degrees? The floating leaves gave it away.', '2006-11-11 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
