(3021702, 424262, 65858, '<td valign="top">Hi Robert, welcome to DPC.  So here''s what I would say about this one.  While it is a reflection (and a pretty sharp reflection, looking at others in this challenge), there''s not really a wow factor.  The tone is a bit flat, and there doesn''t appear to be any interesting subject that my eye is drawn toward.<br/> <br/>Don''t be too discouraged, though.  This was a difficult challenge in which to create something unique and fetching.  Learn, and keep trying!<br/> <br/>Cheers,<br/>-Jeff</td>', 'Hi Robert, welcome to DPC.  So here''s what I would say about this one.  While it is a reflection (and a pretty sharp reflection, looking at others in this challenge), there''s not really a wow factor.  The tone is a bit flat, and there doesn''t appear to be any interesting subject that my eye is drawn toward. Don''t be too discouraged, though.  This was a difficult challenge in which to create something unique and fetching.  Learn, and keep trying! Cheers,-Jeff', '2006-11-11 09:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3021704, 423941, 65858, '<td valign="top">Interesting take.  This may have had more impact if the girl and her reflection were in focus using a smaller aperture.  Nice framing/crop and natural vignette.</td>', 'Interesting take.  This may have had more impact if the girl and her reflection were in focus using a smaller aperture.  Nice framing/crop and natural vignette.', '2006-11-11 09:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
