(3021709, 424400, 65858, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery, good eye, but technically it is there.  I''m guessing this is a low end camera, or a small crop.  Could use better levels (black should look lack, not grey), less JPEG compression, and flat horizon to start with.</td>', 'Nice scenery, good eye, but technically it is there.  I''m guessing this is a low end camera, or a small crop.  Could use better levels (black should look lack, not grey), less JPEG compression, and flat horizon to start with.', '2006-11-11 10:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
