(3022450, 423993, 66952, '<td valign="top">I think that big blob in the upper left is sensor dust. In the new basic editing rules, you can now clone sensor dust out. Other than that, excellent!</td>', 'I think that big blob in the upper left is sensor dust. In the new basic editing rules, you can now clone sensor dust out. Other than that, excellent!', '2006-11-11 19:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022453, 424454, 55642, '<td valign="top">I would like this a lot better if it weren''t so oversaturated. I think the red is fine, though maybe it needs a little slide more into orange, but the blue is defitely overdone. Still, everything else about it, technically and compositionally, looks really nice.</td>', 'I would like this a lot better if it weren''t so oversaturated. I think the red is fine, though maybe it needs a little slide more into orange, but the blue is defitely overdone. Still, everything else about it, technically and compositionally, looks really nice.', '2006-11-11 19:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022456, 423907, 26464, '<td valign="top">strange how they seem to be suspended.. but nothing underneath, unless i can''t see the glass.</td>', 'strange how they seem to be suspended.. but nothing underneath, unless i can''t see the glass.', '2006-11-11 19:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022457, 423289, 66952, '<td valign="top">The reflection and composition are nice, but the light is a bit harsh, maybe bounce the flash off of an umbrella or something. And I hate to say it, but the volume knob is just disgusting, which really affected my overall impression of the image.</td>', 'The reflection and composition are nice, but the light is a bit harsh, maybe bounce the flash off of an umbrella or something. And I hate to say it, but the volume knob is just disgusting, which really affected my overall impression of the image.', '2006-11-11 19:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022460, 424433, 26464, '<td valign="top">? bizarre... but i like the effect.</td>', '? bizarre... but i like the effect.', '2006-11-11 20:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022461, 424433, 55642, '<td valign="top">There aren''t many who will like this photo, I''m afraid, but I''m not one of those. I love the impressionist feel and the apparent wrinkles in the fabric. Lovely and timeless.</td>', 'There aren''t many who will like this photo, I''m afraid, but I''m not one of those. I love the impressionist feel and the apparent wrinkles in the fabric. Lovely and timeless.', '2006-11-11 20:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022464, 424360, 26464, '<td valign="top">interesting... looks like you flipped the photo? nicely done</td>', 'interesting... looks like you flipped the photo? nicely done', '2006-11-11 20:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022466, 424307, 55642, '<td valign="top">I don''t mind the intent of the processing here at all. I think it does wonderful things for the colors. However, I think it went a little too far. I''m looking specifically at the model''s face, hands, and socks, where the whites are really too bright.</td>', 'I don''t mind the intent of the processing here at all. I think it does wonderful things for the colors. However, I think it went a little too far. I''m looking specifically at the model''s face, hands, and socks, where the whites are really too bright.', '2006-11-11 20:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022475, 424092, 55642, '<td valign="top">What great freckles!</td>', 'What great freckles!', '2006-11-11 20:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3022477, 423502, 55642, '<td valign="top">This is gorgeous. Excellent decision to include that sliver of shoreline at the bottom - it makes it looks like the trees are standing on a ledge where everything suddenly goes into an impressionist fog.</td>', 'This is gorgeous. Excellent decision to include that sliver of shoreline at the bottom - it makes it looks like the trees are standing on a ledge where everything suddenly goes into an impressionist fog.', '2006-11-11 20:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
