(3023073, 423723, 10867, '<td valign="top">The colours and reflections are lovely, but the horizon is definitely tilted towards the left and the intruding bunch of leaves at the top left and the bit of golden foliage t the top right should have been cropped out, I think.  These things distract us from what would otherwise be a beautiful image.</td>', 'The colours and reflections are lovely, but the horizon is definitely tilted towards the left and the intruding bunch of leaves at the top left and the bit of golden foliage t the top right should have been cropped out, I think.  These things distract us from what would otherwise be a beautiful image.', '2006-11-12 00:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
