(3028953, 424387, 68504, '<td valign="top">Almost pleasing. (Sorry, this doesn''t sound right:  what I meant was that it comes very very close- limited palette, dew drop, double reflection, definition of petal edges, light and dark contrast, highlighting of rose and barest indication of stem and leaves all great components;  I''m genuinely puzzled why it doesn''t totally work for me.  Interestingly, I find if I get stand up and look at my screen from the direction of the source of the light, things come alive).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-12-19 19:06:39.</i></td>', 'Almost pleasing. (Sorry, this doesn''t sound right:  what I meant was that it comes very very close- limited palette, dew drop, double reflection, definition of petal edges, light and dark contrast, highlighting of rose and barest indication of stem and leaves all great components;  I''m genuinely puzzled why it doesn''t totally work for me.  Interestingly, I find if I get stand up and look at my screen from the direction of the source of the light, things come alive).', '2006-11-14 00:16:42.000000', '2006-12-19 19:06:39.000000', 1),
