(3029022, 424404, 68504, '<td valign="top">Yes, this is very nice;  the timing has not been prejudiced by trying to lighten the dark foreground.</td>', 'Yes, this is very nice;  the timing has not been prejudiced by trying to lighten the dark foreground.', '2006-11-14 00:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
