(3029031, 424300, 68504, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition, but the unreflected feet don''t quite balance the attractive way the legs and jeans are reflected in the water.</td>', 'Nice simple composition, but the unreflected feet don''t quite balance the attractive way the legs and jeans are reflected in the water.', '2006-11-14 01:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029032, 424151, 15511, '<td valign="top">This is nice, the crop is too close...</td>', 'This is nice, the crop is too close...', '2006-11-14 01:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029036, 422935, 68504, '<td valign="top">Just a soupcon of a beautiful woman in a fine fur (real?) coat.  A few too many white lights - some would be okay.</td>', 'Just a soupcon of a beautiful woman in a fine fur (real?) coat.  A few too many white lights - some would be okay.', '2006-11-14 01:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029042, 423936, 68504, '<td valign="top">I rather like the effect of the overexposure on the composition.  But lack of definition (at this size?) detracts.</td>', 'I rather like the effect of the overexposure on the composition.  But lack of definition (at this size?) detracts.', '2006-11-14 01:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029044, 424362, 68504, '<td valign="top">Actually quite good.  Wonder about the effect of the haze in the upper left and the brightness on the left;  might be better balanced by a little more darkness on the right.</td>', 'Actually quite good.  Wonder about the effect of the haze in the upper left and the brightness on the left;  might be better balanced by a little more darkness on the right.', '2006-11-14 01:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029047, 423907, 68504, '<td valign="top">Ugh.  These are not flies. Are they reflected, or just lying on the surface?</td>', 'Ugh.  These are not flies. Are they reflected, or just lying on the surface?', '2006-11-14 01:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029048, 422552, 68504, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and composition.  Dull tones utterly appropriate to the reflecting medium.</td>', 'Nice lighting and composition.  Dull tones utterly appropriate to the reflecting medium.', '2006-11-14 01:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029057, 423252, 24970, '<td valign="top">Love the soft colors and smooth feel to this shot. One of my ribbon picks. The crop might be a little square for the horizontal lines of this, but it works nonetheless.</td>', 'Love the soft colors and smooth feel to this shot. One of my ribbon picks. The crop might be a little square for the horizontal lines of this, but it works nonetheless.', '2006-11-14 01:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029058, 422950, 24970, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot. I love the simplicity. I can''t decide if the break between two background colors adds or takes away from the shot. A solid, continuous background may have been good, instead of the red &amp; green tints present here. That aside, this is one of my ribbon picks. Well done!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot. I love the simplicity. I can''t decide if the break between two background colors adds or takes away from the shot. A solid, continuous background may have been good, instead of the red & green tints present here. That aside, this is one of my ribbon picks. Well done!', '2006-11-14 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029059, 424300, 24970, '<td valign="top">Very unique perspective. I love the clarity and balance of this shot. The border works well to contain it and emphasize structure. One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'Very unique perspective. I love the clarity and balance of this shot. The border works well to contain it and emphasize structure. One of my ribbon picks.', '2006-11-14 01:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029062, 424173, 24970, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, colors, and composition. This is a stunning shot. I expect to see it in the top 5 if not a ribbon.</td>', 'Great contrast, colors, and composition. This is a stunning shot. I expect to see it in the top 5 if not a ribbon.', '2006-11-14 01:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029065, 424407, 24970, '<td valign="top">I''m really drawn into this picture. I''d say the horizon looks crooked but the point of entry for the front two posts is dead on, so this works for me. The lighting is stunning, too. In my top 10.</td>', 'I''m really drawn into this picture. I''d say the horizon looks crooked but the point of entry for the front two posts is dead on, so this works for me. The lighting is stunning, too. In my top 10.', '2006-11-14 01:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029068, 423317, 68504, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination of reflective surfaces; good attempt at composition.</td>', 'Interesting combination of reflective surfaces; good attempt at composition.', '2006-11-14 01:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029070, 424389, 68504, '<td valign="top">very pleasing</td>', 'very pleasing', '2006-11-14 01:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
