(3029153, 424307, 68504, '<td valign="top">Most interesting.  Graininess, supersaturation, outsized foot and the wealth of interwoven reflections are somehow all of a piece. And now that it''s over, let me say this was The most interesting and provocative of all the submissions. (Possibly the face and hand and socks are ''blown'' but this is photography not drawing, not painting, not sculpting).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-16 01:44:42.</i></td>', 'Most interesting.  Graininess, supersaturation, outsized foot and the wealth of interwoven reflections are somehow all of a piece. And now that it''s over, let me say this was The most interesting and provocative of all the submissions. (Possibly the face and hand and socks are ''blown'' but this is photography not drawing, not painting, not sculpting).', '2006-11-14 02:24:23.000000', '2006-11-16 01:44:42.000000', 1),
(3029156, 424247, 47640, '<td valign="top">Hey! This looks like it could have been Shanny''s photo!! Good one!</td>', 'Hey! This looks like it could have been Shanny''s photo!! Good one!', '2006-11-14 02:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029166, 423505, 68504, '<td valign="top">Overall light abnd darks are good. Wish reflected object were more interesting, though the subtle colouring of the same is good</td>', 'Overall light abnd darks are good. Wish reflected object were more interesting, though the subtle colouring of the same is good', '2006-11-14 02:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029182, 424251, 68504, '<td valign="top">Some very nice things happening with the leaf reflections in the background, and the pelican(?) is nicely situated.  Would be nice if the bright green verticals above his head and below the curve of his neck where edited out plus the round blob thing and the unfocused bright vertical. Unusual to get such a pleasing background for a stately subject.  (The thumbnail gives no indication of the richness of this picture).</td>', 'Some very nice things happening with the leaf reflections in the background, and the pelican(?) is nicely situated.  Would be nice if the bright green verticals above his head and below the curve of his neck where edited out plus the round blob thing and the unfocused bright vertical. Unusual to get such a pleasing background for a stately subject.  (The thumbnail gives no indication of the richness of this picture).', '2006-11-14 02:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029199, 423232, 9478, '<td valign="top">Awesome.</td>', 'Awesome.', '2006-11-14 03:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029200, 424392, 68504, '<td valign="top">Sensuous. Mr. Mallard''s shiny luminous/metallic round head vis a vis the oily round swirl of red gold reflection...</td>', 'Sensuous. Mr. Mallard''s shiny luminous/metallic round head vis a vis the oily round swirl of red gold reflection...', '2006-11-14 03:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029210, 423772, 68504, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing colour balances, and the bare trees to the left are expressive;  I''m just not sure if the photo is balances side to side.</td>', 'Very pleasing colour balances, and the bare trees to the left are expressive;  I''m just not sure if the photo is balances side to side.', '2006-11-14 03:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029213, 423196, 68504, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition with the red twigs(?) in the lower left balancing the red and white of the lighthouse in the upper right, and the subtle browns of the water and denuded woods.  Like the texture of the woods and the strong verticals of the reflexions.</td>', 'Interesting composition with the red twigs(?) in the lower left balancing the red and white of the lighthouse in the upper right, and the subtle browns of the water and denuded woods.  Like the texture of the woods and the strong verticals of the reflexions.', '2006-11-14 03:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029219, 421498, 68504, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition, but I''m stymied as to how the back of the leaf could be reflected.</td>', 'Stunning composition, but I''m stymied as to how the back of the leaf could be reflected.', '2006-11-14 03:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029234, 424463, 68504, '<td valign="top">Stunning:  both rich and subtle.The structure of this picture rests on the white/whitish verticals of the tree trunks and their reflexions.  The flow of orangy red from left to right seems to enhance this structure. I''m not too sure of the topmost line of sky:  what about cropping it just down to where the first wisps of cloud appear in the centre?</td>', 'Stunning:  both rich and subtle.The structure of this picture rests on the white/whitish verticals of the tree trunks and their reflexions.  The flow of orangy red from left to right seems to enhance this structure. I''m not too sure of the topmost line of sky:  what about cropping it just down to where the first wisps of cloud appear in the centre?', '2006-11-14 03:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029236, 424265, 52549, '<td valign="top">Is this a reflection? It looks like two boys. The shot is pretty noisy, interesting nevertheless.</td>', 'Is this a reflection? It looks like two boys. The shot is pretty noisy, interesting nevertheless.', '2006-11-14 03:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029238, 424038, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours and most likely a ribbon winner.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours and most likely a ribbon winner.', '2006-11-14 03:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029253, 423774, 68504, '<td valign="top">Nice heron. Sun''s path on water just a bit too blown, but the mood is good.</td>', 'Nice heron. Sun''s path on water just a bit too blown, but the mood is good.', '2006-11-14 04:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3029257, 423681, 68504, '<td valign="top">Such a nice soap bubble, so obediently sitting on the carafe;  a shame about the blah background.  Do it again in a window or outside, wind permitting.</td>', 'Such a nice soap bubble, so obediently sitting on the carafe;  a shame about the blah background.  Do it again in a window or outside, wind permitting.', '2006-11-14 04:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
