(3029290, 424453, 68504, '<td valign="top">Arresting. Great sky drama balanced by low tide blobs and reflexions, and very interestingly lit row of sedges(?) and tree outlines separating them.</td>', 'Arresting. Great sky drama balanced by low tide blobs and reflexions, and very interestingly lit row of sedges(?) and tree outlines separating them.', '2006-11-14 04:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
