(3032418, 423658, 14476, '<td valign="top">Just beautiful.  Either image would have scored well.  While I was one of your "10" votes, I''m pleased to see there were 18 more.  Truly, an exquisite image.</td>', 'Just beautiful.  Either image would have scored well.  While I was one of your "10" votes, I''m pleased to see there were 18 more.  Truly, an exquisite image.', '2006-11-15 00:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
