(3032693, 424301, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot - and by the way, I disagree with a few of the more accomplished than me folks who commented - what makes this shot appealing to me is the fourth tree.  Yes, threes are more balanced (rule of odds, not just threes) but I like this poor little "I think I can" tree at the end.</td>', 'Nice shot - and by the way, I disagree with a few of the more accomplished than me folks who commented - what makes this shot appealing to me is the fourth tree.  Yes, threes are more balanced (rule of odds, not just threes) but I like this poor little "I think I can" tree at the end.', '2006-11-15 00:42:22.000000', NULL, 0),
