(3034148, 424454, 4226, '<td valign="top">thanks for your comments. I was trying a different processing with this one, specially the rocks. they were a part of the cross-processing. The rocks get a green tone due to that. its just a curves layer red channel modification...</td>', 'thanks for your comments. I was trying a different processing with this one, specially the rocks. they were a part of the cross-processing. The rocks get a green tone due to that. its just a curves layer red channel modification...', '2006-11-15 12:12:49.000000', NULL, 0),
