(3034160, 424392, 43404, '<td valign="top">Sweet score and placing sista llama!  (You''ll always be a llama to me) There''s an odd statement eh?  Well not for us. LOL.   LLCL!</td>', 'Sweet score and placing sista llama!  (You''ll always be a llama to me) There''s an odd statement eh?  Well not for us. LOL.   LLCL!', '2006-11-15 12:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034161, 423025, 28490, '<td valign="top">In looking at my disappointing scores for the recent challenge (Reflection Without Mirrors), it makes me wonder if people really looked at my photograph at all. Clearly I could not have used a mirror in my photograph. One apple has a huge bite out of it while the other one does not. I received many DNMC''s. This experience has had the positive effect of motiviating me to be a better reviewer- taking time to actually study a picture before I assign a score. But I wonder if other members have had the same frustrating experience.<br/> <br/>[user]//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=423025[/user]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-11-15 12:17:02.</i></td>', 'In looking at my disappointing scores for the recent challenge (Reflection Without Mirrors), it makes me wonder if people really looked at my photograph at all. Clearly I could not have used a mirror in my photograph. One apple has a huge bite out of it while the other one does not. I received many DNMC''s. This experience has had the positive effect of motiviating me to be a better reviewer- taking time to actually study a picture before I assign a score. But I wonder if other members have had the same frustrating experience. [user]//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=423025[/user]', '2006-11-15 12:16:18.000000', '2006-11-15 12:17:02.000000', 0),
(3034175, 421713, 51538, '<td valign="top">Still a sizzling image for me - no matter what those other voters say...</td>', 'Still a sizzling image for me - no matter what those other voters say...', '2006-11-15 12:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034178, 422974, 43404, '<td valign="top">One other tricky and tiny point to consider is a slightly shorter shutterspeed.. it is a toss up between blowing out a few highlights or the photo being too dark.  The light in almost dead center is pretty distracting and that tends to cost you a bit in the voting.  Hope this helps.  The reflection part is great.  EB</td>', 'One other tricky and tiny point to consider is a slightly shorter shutterspeed.. it is a toss up between blowing out a few highlights or the photo being too dark.  The light in almost dead center is pretty distracting and that tends to cost you a bit in the voting.  Hope this helps.  The reflection part is great.  EB', '2006-11-15 12:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034221, 424360, 62903, '<td valign="top">I love the colors because of the season changes that fall brings.<br/>I think the people who voted the ones were not sane.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the colors because of the season changes that fall brings.I think the people who voted the ones were not sane. ', '2006-11-15 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034378, 424384, 52549, '<td valign="top">I agree with Sandy - can''t understand why this didn''t score higher. The background colour suits the mood perfectly and the clarity is fantastic.</td>', 'I agree with Sandy - can''t understand why this didn''t score higher. The background colour suits the mood perfectly and the clarity is fantastic.', '2006-11-15 13:08:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034384, 423720, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is definitely underrated. It''s beautifully photographed and the reflection is perfect. Great job.</td>', 'This is definitely underrated. It''s beautifully photographed and the reflection is perfect. Great job.', '2006-11-15 13:10:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034388, 421498, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot, one of my favourites. Congrats on top 10.</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot, one of my favourites. Congrats on top 10.', '2006-11-15 13:12:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(3034394, 423232, 2716, '<td valign="top">sweet</td>', 'sweet', '2006-11-15 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
