(3050650, 423025, 50695, '<td valign="top">The bitemark would be facing the mirror, not the camera, and so would not necessarily be visible. To me, whether or not this was actually a mirror was irrelevant. The appleskin is a reflective surface so it was not DNMC. I actually gave it a higher score because of the transgressive nature of the picture.</td>', 'The bitemark would be facing the mirror, not the camera, and so would not necessarily be visible. To me, whether or not this was actually a mirror was irrelevant. The appleskin is a reflective surface so it was not DNMC. I actually gave it a higher score because of the transgressive nature of the picture.', '2006-11-21 12:45:18.000000', NULL, 0),
