(3060897, 424419, 61448, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by rinac:</b></div><hr/><i> adg gfeyw bj bfjef bfwj... kekekeke. Did anyone really party like it''s 1999? ;) Incidently, I had my second child that year, and I definitely do not regret either. Nice take on the challenge, good luck! :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I don''t think many here get the "Jimmie" take on things. Since my posts are NOT all pretty and "adjusted" I take me beating... but they should look a bit deeper... I do have a few things to offer.<br/>And.... how the heck have ya been????</td>', 'Originally posted by rinac: adg gfeyw bj bfjef bfwj... kekekeke. Did anyone really party like it''s 1999? ;) Incidently, I had my second child that year, and I definitely do not regret either. Nice take on the challenge, good luck! :)   I don''t think many here get the "Jimmie" take on things. Since my posts are NOT all pretty and "adjusted" I take me beating... but they should look a bit deeper... I do have a few things to offer.And.... how the heck have ya been????', '2006-11-25 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
