(3105428, 424358, 31399, '<td valign="top">WHY I went for clarity of reflection (because challenge title was ''reflection''?)....grrr me...next time I do better on focus and clarity.</td>', 'WHY I went for clarity of reflection (because challenge title was ''reflection''?)....grrr me...next time I do better on focus and clarity.', '2006-12-11 01:04:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(3108321, 424226, 46046, '<td valign="top">fabulous photo!  I love that if you squint your eyes you can lose the subject but yet the subject is so obvious.  This photo is a real accomplishment.  Congrats on a recognizing a very sophisticated composition and getting a great capture.  .............Boy that comment sounds more pretentious than anything I have ever written here but I really like this shot so I''ll bear my own pretention.</td>', 'fabulous photo!  I love that if you squint your eyes you can lose the subject but yet the subject is so obvious.  This photo is a real accomplishment.  Congrats on a recognizing a very sophisticated composition and getting a great capture.  .............Boy that comment sounds more pretentious than anything I have ever written here but I really like this shot so I''ll bear my own pretention.', '2006-12-12 01:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(3130988, 424092, 60862, '<td valign="top">Boy, you sure know how to take great pics of kids!  Another terrific memory for you. :)</td>', 'Boy, you sure know how to take great pics of kids!  Another terrific memory for you. :)', '2006-12-19 09:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3131863, 421685, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh this is so gorgeous. Lovely colors, and the detail is so great that I feel like I can see each individual leaf.  Great image.<br/> <br/>Not sure what voters were looking for in this challenge but taking the photo on its own I just love how the ripples in the water break up the reflection - you still know it is a reflection but there is some interesting stuff going on at the bottom that makes me want to look at it more.</td>', 'Oh this is so gorgeous. Lovely colors, and the detail is so great that I feel like I can see each individual leaf.  Great image. Not sure what voters were looking for in this challenge but taking the photo on its own I just love how the ripples in the water break up the reflection - you still know it is a reflection but there is some interesting stuff going on at the bottom that makes me want to look at it more.', '2006-12-19 15:20:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(3132398, 423720, 68504, '<td valign="top">Missed this one.  Brilliant lighting, texture of water and bird.</td>', 'Missed this one.  Brilliant lighting, texture of water and bird.', '2006-12-19 18:49:32.000000', NULL, 0),
