(3553664, 424412, 64994, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, and really strange as I just last night started experimenting with this very same thing in the local park!!! I''ll upload to my port. still have to practice to get it right but I think it will be cool in the end...and this should have been at least mid 5''s at least.</td>', 'Cool shot, and really strange as I just last night started experimenting with this very same thing in the local park!!! I''ll upload to my port. still have to practice to get it right but I think it will be cool in the end...and this should have been at least mid 5''s at least.', '2007-04-16 21:49:56.000000', NULL, 0),
