(3566825, 423662, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely photo. The reflection is not obvious, and I think that is what hurt your score in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a lovely photo. The reflection is not obvious, and I think that is what hurt your score in this challenge.', '2007-04-20 19:10:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(3608990, 423806, 38930, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  I was just at an airshow with the Thunderbirds where they were doing stuff like this, and I never got a shot with such great timing!</td>', 'This is awesome!  I was just at an airshow with the Thunderbirds where they were doing stuff like this, and I never got a shot with such great timing!', '2007-05-03 01:41:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(3619857, 423658, 34938, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 9...it really has so much going for it...the gentle touch of the wing and the water...the flight...the composition...the blue...all form leave a great imapct...congrats on a top 5 finish. Cropping it the way you did was the amster stroke of genius, cause it leaves the viewer imagining what is happening beyond the frame</td>', 'I gave this a 9...it really has so much going for it...the gentle touch of the wing and the water...the flight...the composition...the blue...all form leave a great imapct...congrats on a top 5 finish. Cropping it the way you did was the amster stroke of genius, cause it leaves the viewer imagining what is happening beyond the frame', '2007-05-06 03:52:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(3758291, 423806, 62009, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot and timing...I was trying to get that one, but kept missing.</td>', 'Awesome shot and timing...I was trying to get that one, but kept missing.', '2007-06-08 19:17:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(3780138, 424454, 43031, '<td valign="top">wow, haven''t seen this one before. beautiful. I bet this is awesome in a print.</td>', 'wow, haven''t seen this one before. beautiful. I bet this is awesome in a print.', '2007-06-13 20:28:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3788677, 424454, 49865, '<td valign="top">You''re right, this is an angle you never see. I like the reflection of the bridge in the pool and the wonderful range of colors here. Parts of the image feel a little bit dark, though.</td>', 'You''re right, this is an angle you never see. I like the reflection of the bridge in the pool and the wonderful range of colors here. Parts of the image feel a little bit dark, though.', '2007-06-15 16:12:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(3845949, 423907, 61986, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by novetan:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by santiago9er:</b></div><hr/><i> So where''s the reflection? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Please open your eyes. There were also a few others asking the same question. <br/> <br/>This picture was taken in a shallow lake (about one foot deep) with bright granite bed. The dead flies were floating and their shadows, including the mineral bottle, were cast onto the bright granite bed. Can you see their reflection now? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Maybe you need to look up what a reflection is.  Casting a shadow is not a reflection.  It is a very unique shot and I like the composition, it just didn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Originally posted by novetan: Originally posted by santiago9er: So where''s the reflection?   Please open your eyes. There were also a few others asking the same question.  This picture was taken in a shallow lake (about one foot deep) with bright granite bed. The dead flies were floating and their shadows, including the mineral bottle, were cast onto the bright granite bed. Can you see their reflection now?   Maybe you need to look up what a reflection is.  Casting a shadow is not a reflection.  It is a very unique shot and I like the composition, it just didn''t meet the challenge.', '2007-06-28 17:56:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(3985994, 421925, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, what an amazing abstractish image. Wonderful colors and composition.  Truly beautiful.</td>', 'Wow, what an amazing abstractish image. Wonderful colors and composition.  Truly beautiful.', '2007-08-10 03:43:35.000000', NULL, 0),
