(4067474, 424225, 70000, '<td valign="top">what a neat moment, i love the relfection in the water. i think you could play off the out of focus look by making it even more out of focus and hazy to add a dreamy feel to it</td>', 'what a neat moment, i love the relfection in the water. i think you could play off the out of focus look by making it even more out of focus and hazy to add a dreamy feel to it', '2007-09-07 00:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
