(6754421, 424433, 66384, '<td valign="top">I already commented on this, but it is still one of my all time favorites. The position of yourself in the frame, the color palette, the texture and grunge, all come together to make a masterful impressionistic portrait of a proud and dignified artist. I think this would be great printed on canvas and hung above your mantel piece or on the dining room wall.</td>', 'I already commented on this, but it is still one of my all time favorites. The position of yourself in the frame, the color palette, the texture and grunge, all come together to make a masterful impressionistic portrait of a proud and dignified artist. I think this would be great printed on canvas and hung above your mantel piece or on the dining room wall.', '2012-04-29 12:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
